      "description": "<p data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"3053\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2945\">Arthur Fiedler – A Legendary Performer</strong><br data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2948\">\nRCA Red Seal CRL1-2064<br data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2973\">\n1977 U.S. Stereo Vinyl LP<br data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3001\">\nFeaturing Arthur Fiedler &amp; the Boston Pops Orchestra<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3232\">A retrospective collection celebrating legendary Boston Pops conductor Arthur Fiedler, combining classical favorites, Broadway selections, popular music, and American standards.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3253\">Selections include:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3535\">\n<li data-section-id=\"q4nmlr\" data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3275\">\nStrike Up the Band\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"bxq32i\" data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3286\">\nJalousie\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mqaoii\" data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3309\">\nWaltz of the Flowers\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"tnpzl6\" data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3329\">\nRitual Fire Dance\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"bu6h3g\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3356\">\nProcession of the Sardar\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ola6bj\" data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3391\">\nCavalleria Rusticana: Intermezzo\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"c4iuhu\" data-start=\"3392\" data-end=\"3405\">\nSabre Dance\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"17k5uet\" data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3428\">\nWine, Woman and Song\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1svlpfw\" data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3450\">\nMy Fair Lady Medley\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xerb63\" data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3477\">\nI Want to Hold Your Hand\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1on4cgg\" data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3503\">\nBoogie Woogie Bugle Boy\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1t8vdx4\" data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3535\">\nThe Stars and Stripes Forever\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3803\"><strong data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3551\">Condition:</strong> Vinyl visually graded VG+ with strong gloss and light signs of handling. Jacket remains in its original shrink wrap with light edge/corner wear. Includes the original illustrated booklet/picture insert. Shrink is open and record is not factory sealed.</p>",
